  "ruleText": "Med 502.02 Noncompliance with Standards as Unprofessional Conduct. Noncompliance with the standards set forth in this part may constitute unprofessional conduct as used in NH RSA 329:17, VI(d).\n\nSource. #11090, eff 5-3-16; ss by #12038, eff 1-1-17",
